@startuml activity-similarity-search
!include _style.puml
skinparam wrapWidth 150

|User|
start
:Take or select a photo
of the unknown object;
|Web application|
:Send the photo
to the API;
|API|
:Trim the border, scale
to 224 px, normalise;
:Compute the DINOv2
embedding (384 values);
:Find the nearest
stored images
(cosine distance);
:Re-rank look-alikes
with patch features;
:Keep the best image
per object, take top K;
|Web application|
:Show the candidates
with score bands;
|User|
if (Object found?) then (yes)
  :Open the
  object record;
  stop
else (no)
  :Register it as
  a new object;
  stop
endif
@enduml
